  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caribbean - 4th Safeguarding Technical Working Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conducted 4th meeting of the STWG. The objective of the meeting was to highlight the achievements of the last year, and to discuss activities to undertake in the upcoming year, including: the development of the adopted Market Access Template into a Regional standard through CAHFSA; the presentation of the Plant Import Risk Analysis document for adoption by the Forum at CPHD 9; the use of the Regions PRA Units to function as centers of excellence; and templates for the standardization of Phytosanitary Certificates and Import Permits according to IPPC guidelines to be presented to the Forum for adoption.</narrative>
  </description>
